L0510: Unsupported specification form

Type specs contain implicitly public function, logical-function, constant and supported associated-type headers. Module specs, generic methods, associated types in generic families, nested Self inputs and borrowed/container Self results are deferred.

```rust reject L0510
spec type Counter { pub fn read() -> u8; }
```

Remove the member's `pub`; put visibility on `spec type Counter`. For a deferred form, the diagnostic names the limitation. It is never silently treated as a trusted declaration.

Language, as built: [1.29:1](../spec/18-specifications.md).
